; Regression test for issue #3327: selling part of a lot after its price
; has moved.
;
; ABC rose from $10 to $30, and then 5 of the 10 ABC were sold at $30.
; The sale realizes $100 of the gain, booked to Income:Gains, so only the
; $100 gain on the 5 ABC still held is unrealized: market value less cost
; basis, 5 x ($30 - $10).

2024-01-01 Buy
    Assets:Broker    10 ABC @ $10.00
    Assets:Cash

P 2024-03-01 ABC $30.00

2024-04-01 Sell
    Assets:Broker    -5 ABC {$10.00} @ $30.00
    Assets:Cash      $150.00
    Income:Gains

test bal -V --unrealized --now 2024/06/01
             $200.00  Assets
             $150.00    Broker
              $50.00    Cash
            $-100.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
            $-100.00  Income:Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

; Limited to the assets, the report totals their cost basis, which is
; higher by the realized gain booked to Income:Gains.
test bal -V --unrealized --now 2024/06/01 Assets
             $200.00  Assets
             $150.00    Broker
              $50.00    Cash
            $-100.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
             $100.00
end test

; Limited to the broker, the report totals the cost basis of the 5 ABC
; still held.
test bal -V --unrealized --now 2024/06/01 Broker
             $150.00  Assets:Broker
            $-100.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
              $50.00
end test
